        "original_id": "96950000-23ad-5ace-8725-c46069171951",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Rensselaer Plateau, Adirondack Mountains, Round Pond, New York City, New York, eastern Quebec, Nova Scotia, New England, Appalachians, western North Carolina\n- Plants: Eastern White Pine, Eastern Hemlock, Red Spruce, Balsam Fir, Red Pine, Tamarack, Picea rubens\n- People: Ricardo Carreras\n- Topics: vegetation, geologic formations, native range\n\nFacts:\n- Ricardo Carreras was born in New York City, New York.\n- Round Pond in Berlin, New York, is located on the geologic formation known as the Rensselaer Plateau.\n- Vegetation on the Rensselaer Plateau is more similar to vegetation in the Adirondack Mountains to the northwest.\n- The Rensselaer Plateau has abundant Eastern White Pine, Eastern Hemlock, Red Spruce, and Balsam Fir, with more limited occurrences of Red Pine and Tamarack.\n- Picea rubens, commonly known as red spruce, is a species of spruce native to eastern North America.\n- The native range of Picea rubens extends from eastern Quebec to Nova Scotia and from New England south through the Adirondack Mountains and Appalachians to western North Carolina.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "daa2ff7d-6d4b-5cf6-843a-53d0b347b448",
        "text": "Page: Rensselaer Plateau. Sentence: Vegetation on the plateau is more similar to that found in the Adirondack Mountains to the northwest, with abundant Eastern White Pine, Eastern Hemlock, Red Spruce, and Balsam Fir, along with more limited occurrences of Red Pine and Tamarack.\nPage: Picea rubens. Sentence: Picea rubens, commonly known as red spruce, is a species of spruce native to eastern North America, ranging from eastern Quebec to Nova Scotia, and from New England south in the Adirondack Mountains and Appalachians to western North Carolina.\nPage: Round Pond (Berlin, New York). Sentence: The lake is located on a geologic formation known as the Rensselaer Plateau.\nPage: Ricardo Carreras. Sentence: Carreras was born in New York City, New York.",
